>> time required: 45 minutes
>> course: apero
>> serves: 4

Heat @milk{100%ml} in a #saucepan{} with a pinch of @agar agar{}(optional) until just simmering. Off the heat, soak @bread{2%slices}(soft crumb only, crusts removed) in the milk until fully absorbed. Chill in the #fridge{} for ~{30%minutes} — if using agar it must be cold and set before blending.

Blend @smoked cod roe{125%g} with the soaked bread and milk in a #food processor{} until smooth.

With the motor running, pour in @avocado oil{200%ml} in a thin stream to emulsify. Loosen with cold @water{} if it tightens up.

Season with @salt{} and the juice of @lemon{1}.

Finish with the lemon zest and a drizzle of good @olive oil{}.
